OL,3,GNEWSABadenoch welcomes expanded
OL,4,Agrooming gangs inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative party leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,7,Fhas said she welcomes the inclusion of
OL,8,FBirmingham in a national inquiry into
OL,9,Fchild sexual exploitation, and hoped it
OL,10,Fmoved quickly to get justice for
OL,11,Fvictims.
OL,13,FThe Statutory Independent Inquiry into
OL,14,FGrooming Gangs announced on Wednesday
OL,15,Fthat it was expanding its focus to
OL,16,FBirmingham and Wales and would look at
OL,17,Fthe prevalence of child sexual
OL,18,Fexploitation (CSE) as well as victim
OL,19,Fand survivor experience.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
