OL,3,GNEWSABadenoch welcomes expanded
OL,4,Agrooming gangs inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're keeping a very close eye on
OL,7,Fwhat's going on because we need to get
OL,8,Fjustice for the victims," she said.
OL,10,FBadenoch was speaking ahead of her
OL,11,Fparty's conference in the city, which
OL,12,Fstarts at the weekend.
